    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Part 9: 物理解释\n",
    "\n",
    "### 为什么曲线类似拉比振荡？\n",
    "\n",
    "**关键原因**：原子和光子保持**量子纠缠**！\n",
    "\n",
    "发射后的态：\n",
    "$$\n",
    "|\\psi\\rangle = c_e(t) |e, \\mathrm{vac}\\rangle + c_0(t) |0, H\\rangle + c_1(t) |1, V\\rangle\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "约化密度矩阵（trace over atom）：\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{aligned}\n",
    "\\rho_{\\mathrm{bin}} &= |c_0|^2 |H\\rangle\\langle H| + |c_1|^2 |V\\rangle\\langle V| \\\\\n",
    "&\\quad + c_0 c_1^* |H\\rangle\\langle V| + c_0^* c_1 |V\\rangle\\langle H|\n",
    "\\end{aligned}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "对角元素：\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{aligned}\n",
    "P_H &= \\langle H|\\rho_{\\mathrm{bin}}|H\\rangle = |c_0|^2 \\\\\n",
    "P_V &= \\langle V|\\rho_{\\mathrm{bin}}|V\\rangle = |c_1|^2\n",
    "\\end{aligned}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "由于系数$c_0(t), c_1(t)$的**量子相干演化**，概率会震荡！\n",
    "\n",
    "### 如何获得经典衰减曲线？\n",
    "\n",
    "使用**量子轨迹方法**：每步后对原子做测量\n",
    "- 如果原子在$|e\\rangle$：继续\n",
    "- 如果原子在$|0\\rangle$或$|1\\rangle$：记录光子并停止\n",
    "\n",
    "这会破坏纠缠，得到经典泊松过程。"
   ]
